# Rifleman's native checks by parity: #111 Summon Bear, #117 Blaster, #127 Recoil Shot.
# Rifleman a against an idle Rifleman b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero rifleman
# #111: the bear toward b, cast frames 1-42; it reaches b.
60 a stick 1 0
60 a tap X 2
61 a stick 0 0
# #117: ground blaster, then a short-hop blaster.
150 a tap X 2
240 a tap B 1
245 a tap X 2
# #127: Recoil Shot, second shot on its frame 17.
330 a stick 0 1
330 a tap X 2
331 a stick 0 0
346 a tap X 2
# #111 counterplay: b's blaster hits a during the bear's cast, so no bear comes.
480 b tap X 2
486 a stick 1 0
486 a tap X 2
487 a stick 0 0
# #111: turn around, and the bear facing left.
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
640 a stick -1 0
642 a stick 0 0
660 a stick -1 0
660 a tap X 2
661 a stick 0 0
# View held again: the second moment.
