#! expect b 167 damage 9.790 hitlag 3 hitstun 8
#! expect a 193 special 0
#! expect a 245 applied jump
#! expect a 245 special 7 form 0
#! expect b 267 damage 12.580 hitlag 3 hitstun 8
#! expect a 268 special 0
